    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe ghaabitaghooku entangama, Samusoni yaaja okukyalira mukazi we mu biseera eby'okukungula engaano, ng'amutwaliire embuzi entototo. Yaakoba ati: “Nhenda kwingira mu kisenge kya mukazi wange.” Aye lata wa mukazi we yaaloba kumuganha kwingira, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'amukoba ati: “Nze nadhuuba nti bwenebwene wamukyayira irala. Kale ni, n'okumugha mwino. Aye muganda we omuto n'amusinga obulungi. Nkweghemba oyo y'obe otwale mu kifo ky'ole.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samusoni yairamu ati: “Ku mukuzi guno tiidha kubaaku musango olw'akabi ke nnaakola Abafilisiti!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho yaaja, yaagema ebibe ebikumi bisatu, yaasiba bibiri bibiri emikira ghalala, yaasibira engada mu kifundwa ky'asibiisa emikira egyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe yamala okukunaania omuliro ku ngada edho, yaalekula ebibe, byaja mu misiri gy'engaano egy'Abafilisiti. Mu nsambo eyo, yaayokya ebinhwa eby'engaano ebikungwirwa, era n'engaano ekaali kukungulwa, ghalala n'emiti emyoliva.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Abafilisiti beebuuza bati: “Naani akoze kino?” Baabakoba bati: “Samusoni mukoirume w'omusaadha ow'e Timuna, n'akoze ekyo kuba omusaadha oyo yatoola muka Samusoni oyo, yaamugha mwine wa Samusoni.” Agho Abafilisiti baaja baayokya omukazi oyo n'ab'omu ndhu ya ise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samusoni yaakoba ati: “Mutyo bwe mukoze? Ndayira nti ndidha kumala kubeesasuulizaaku, memale ngolole.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho yaabalumba n'amaani mangi, yaabaita inho. Olwo yaaja yaaba mu mpuku eri mu lwatika olw'olubaale, mu kiketezo eky'e Etamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Abafilisiti baaja, baasimba weema dhaibwe mu Buyudaaya, era baalumba ekibuga Lehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu ab'omu Buyudaaya baababuuza bati: “Lwaki mwidhie okutulumba?” Baabairamu bati: “Twidhie okugema Samusoni tumusibe, olwo tumukole nga mwene bwe yatukola.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho abasaadha enkumi isatu (3,000) ab'e Buyudaaya, baaja ku mpuku eri mu lwatika olw'olubaale, mu kiketezo eky'e Etamu. Baakoba Samusoni bati: “Toidhi ng'Abafilisiti n'abatufuga? Kale kiki kino ky'otukoze?” Yaabairamu ati: “Abo nabakola nga beene bwe bankola.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baamukoba bati: “Twidhie kukusiba, tukugheeyo ye bali.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samusoni yaabakoba ati: “Mulayire muti timwidha kundhita imwe beene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baakoba bati: “Tuja kukusiba busibe, tukugheeyo ye bali, aye tituja kukwita.” Kale baamusiba emigugha ebiri emiyaaka, baamutoolayo mu lubaale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe baamutuusa e Lehi, Abafilisiti baalumuka okuja y'ali nga baleekaana. Agho omwoyo gwa Musengwa Katonda gwamwidhaku n'amaani, emigugha egyali gimusibye amakono gyakutuka ng'oti n'ewuuzi edhookeibwa omuliro, n'ebifundwa ebyali bimusibye ku ngalo byalekula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Samusoni yaabona eigumba ery'oluba olw'endogoyi eyali yaakafa nga liri agho, yaalironda, yaaliitisa abasaadha lukumi (1,000). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaakoba ati:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho endiwo yaagema Samusoni, yaayeta Musengwa Katonda ati: “Ompaire obughanguzi buno obw'amaani. Aye obwo mpegaano nfe endiwo, era abo abatali bakekete bangeme?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musengwa Katonda yaatuna ekituli eyo e Lehi, mwavaamu amaadhi. Samusoni bwe yamala okunhwa, yairamu obulamu n'amaani. Ensulo eyo baagituuma eriina Enihakkore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15:19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Enihakkore",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mu Luheburayi “En-hakkore” kitegeeza, “Ensulo y'oyo ayeta”. Amakulu nti, oyo ayeta Katonda ng'ali mu buzibu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Era ekaaliyo e Lehi n'okutuusa mpegaano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
